---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for the Portico public website and Portico product.">
  <article class="legal-page section-light">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">The Portico public website does not use analytics, advertising, cookies, account sessions, or tracking pixels.</p>
    <h2>Public website</h2>
    <p>When you visit getportico.tv, the web server receives the normal technical information required to return a page, such as the requested address, time, browser information, and network address. Portico does not use that information to build advertising profiles.</p>
    <h2>Portico product</h2>
    <p>Your Portico Server remains the authority for your media, local users, permissions, playback history, and server settings. Portico Cloud does not relay, cache, inspect, or store private media.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Privacy and security questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:admin@getportico.tv">admin@getportico.tv</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
